WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.474
Step ten.

00:00:00.524 --> 00:00:05.011
Clean-up is short, because the demo keeps its resources in one resource group.

00:00:05.061 --> 00:00:07.488
While the demo runs, the nodes, the load balancer,

00:00:07.538 --> 00:00:09.915
the registry and monitoring ingestion are billed.

00:00:09.965 --> 00:00:12.837
Stop the cluster between sessions to save the compute cost.

00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:15.477
When you are done, delete the resource group in the portal,

00:00:15.527 --> 00:00:17.044
or with one command in Cloud Shell.

00:00:17.094 --> 00:00:20.713
Then check for the managed resource group that Azure created for the Azure Monitor

00:00:20.763 --> 00:00:21.160
workspace.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:24.740
We did not run the clean-up here, because the demo stays up for the walkthrough.
